I'm pleased to announce two hledger releases!

hledger 1.52.4: dependency updates, for packagers.

hledger 1.99.4 (2.0 preview 4): new holdings report, better lot
tracking, command aliases, reorganised help command, run/repl
improvements, barewide balance layout, hledger-ui memory leak fix,
hledger-web security fixes.

https://hledger.org/relnotes.html
https://hledger.org/install

